[en.FOCUS_C12_INVITE_THE_APPLE_FAMILY]
Invite Apple Family

[en.FOCUS_C12_INVITE_THE_APPLE_FAMILY_desc]
The Pie family shares a deep bond with the Apple family, and they too face many problems similar to ours. We can invite them to jointly exploit the mineral resources on this land to prosper together, even if it may not be the most prudent choice at the moment. In the long run, it can strengthen the ties between the two great families.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_INVITE_THE_APPLE_FAMILY]
邀请苹果家族

[zh.FOCUS_C12_INVITE_THE_APPLE_FAMILY_desc]
派家族与苹果家族有着深厚的情谊，他们也面临着许多与我们类似的问题，我们可以邀请他们与我们共同开采这片土地上的矿产来共同富裕，哪怕这不是眼下最明智的选择，但长远看来能促进两大家族之间的纽带

